<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ระบบ 3D ถอดแบบและแสดงผลเหล็กเสริมโครงสร้าง (3D Structural Rebar BIM Visualizer)</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts Prompt -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Three.js & Controls via cdnjs -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Prompt', 'sans-serif'] }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #0f172a; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #334155; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #475569; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Top Header -->
    <header class="bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 px-6 py-2.5 flex justify-between items-center shadow-lg z-20 shrink-0">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-600 to-amber-500 p-2 rounded-xl text-white shadow-md">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes-stacked text-xl"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-bold text-base leading-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    ระบบ 3D ถอดแบบและแสดงผลเหล็กเสริมโครงสร้าง (Realistic BIM Rebar Visualizer)
                    <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-normal">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double text-[9px] mr-1"></i>EIT/BIM Standard Hooks
                    </span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">แบบบ้านครอบครัวไทยร่วมสมัย 3 (ฐานราก, เสาตอม่อ, ดัดงอขอ 135°/90° สมจริง)</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <button onclick="exportToCSV()" class="bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-500 text-white text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-csv"></i> Export BOQ CSV
            </button>
            <button onclick="window.print()" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-print"></i> พิมพ์รายงาน
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Workspace -->
    <div class="flex flex-1 overflow-hidden relative">

        <!-- Left Controls / Price Config Panel -->
        <aside id="sidebar" class="w-80 bg-slate-900/90 border-r border-slate-800 flex flex-col shrink-0 z-10 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-sky-400"></i> ควบคุมการแสดงผล & ราคา
                </span>
                <button onclick="resetAllDefaults()" class="text-[11px] text-sky-400 hover:underline">รีเซ็ต</button>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 overflow-y-auto flex-1 space-y-4">
                
                <!-- 3D Layer Controls -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 space-y-3">
                    <div class="font-semibold text-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700/60 pb-1.5">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sky-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> ควบคุม Layer 3D & วัสดุ</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Material Render Mode -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-300 text-[11px] mb-1">โหมดสีผิวเหล็ก (Rebar Material Mode)</label>
                        <select id="rebar-material-mode" onchange="toggleRebarMaterialMode(this.value)" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-slate-200 text-xs focus:border-sky-500 outline-none">
                            <option value="color">แยกสีตามประเภทเหล็ก (Color Coded)</option>
                            <option value="metallic">เนื้อเหล็กจริงสมจริง (Realistic Metallic Steel)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Concrete Visibility Slider -->
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] mb-1">
                            <span class="text-slate-300">ความโปร่งแสงคอนกรีต</span>
                            <span id="opacity-val" class="text-sky-400 font-mono">35%</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="concrete-opacity" min="0" max="100" value="35" oninput="updateConcreteOpacity(this.value)" class="w-full accent-sky-500 h-1.5 bg-slate-700 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Layer Toggles -->
                    <div class="space-y-2 pt-1">
                        <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer border border-slate-700/50">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-bone text-orange-500"></i> เหล็กเสริมหลัก (Main Rebars)</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-rebars" checked onchange="toggleLayer('rebars', this.checked)" class="accent-orange-500 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer border border-slate-700/50">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-square-minus text-pink-500"></i> เหล็กรัดรอบฐานราก (Perimeter Ties)</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-perim-ties" checked onchange="toggleLayer('perimTies', this.checked)" class="accent-pink-500 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer border border-slate-700/50">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-cube text-sky-400"></i> เนื้อคอนกรีต (Concrete)</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-concrete" checked onchange="toggleLayer('concrete', this.checked)" class="accent-sky-500 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer border border-slate-700/50">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-building text-purple-400"></i> โครงสร้างชั้นบน (คาน/พื้น)</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-superstructure" checked onchange="toggleLayer('superstructure', this.checked)" class="accent-purple-500 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer border border-slate-700/50">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-border-top-left text-emerald-400"></i> ผัง Grid Line & Axis</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-grid" checked onchange="toggleLayer('grid', this.checked)" class="accent-emerald-500 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Unit Cost Config -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="font-semibold text-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700/60 pb-1.5">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins"></i> ราคาต่อหน่วยวัสดุ</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">บาท/หน่วย</span>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">เหล็กข้ออ้อย DB12, DB16 (กก.)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="price-steel-db" value="32" onchange="calculateBOQ()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:border-sky-500 outline-none font-mono">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">เหล็กเส้นกลม/ปลอก RB9 (กก.)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="price-steel-rb" value="30" onchange="calculateBOQ()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:border-sky-500 outline-none font-mono">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">คอนกรีตโครงสร้าง 240 ksc (ลบ.ม.)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="price-conc" value="2400" onchange="calculateBOQ()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:border-sky-500 outline-none font-mono">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">ไม้แบบหล่อคอนกรีต (ตร.ม.)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="price-formwork" value="350" onchange="calculateBOQ()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:border-sky-500 outline-none font-mono">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Structural Parameters -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="font-semibold text-slate-200 border-b border-slate-700/60 pb-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-ruler"></i> พารามิเตอร์เสาตอม่อ
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">ความสูงเสาตอม่อ H (ม.)</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" id="param-stub-height" value="1.5" onchange="onParameterChange()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:border-sky-500 outline-none font-mono">
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Right 3D Viewport & BOQ Panel -->
        <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative bg-slate-950">

            <!-- View Switcher & Quick Summary Header -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 px-6 py-2 flex justify-between items-center shrink-0 z-10">
                <div class="flex space-x-2">
                    <button id="tab-btn-3d" onclick="switchTab('3d')" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-600 text-white shadow flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cube"></i> แบบจำลอง 3D Rebar View
                    </button>
                    <button id="tab-btn-boq" onclick="switchTab('boq')" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-750 border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-table-list"></i> ตาราง BOQ & สรุปราคาเหล็ก
                    </button>
                </div>
                <!-- Realtime Top Summary -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 text-xs">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">น้ำหนักเหล็กเสริมรวม</span>
                        <span id="summary-steel-weight" class="font-bold text-amber-400 font-mono text-sm">0.00 kg</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border-r border-slate-800 h-6"></div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">คอนกรีตรวม (ผัด 5%)</span>
                        <span id="summary-conc-vol" class="font-bold text-sky-400 font-mono text-sm">0.00 m³</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border-r border-slate-800 h-6"></div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 block text-[10px]">งบประมาณประมาณการ</span>
                        <span id="summary-total-cost" class="font-extrabold text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3D Canvas Container -->
            <div id="view-3d" class="absolute inset-0 top-[49px] w-full h-[calc(100%-49px)]">
                <canvas id="three-canvas" class="w-full h-full block cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing"></canvas>

                <!-- Legend Box -->
                <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 glass-panel p-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-2xl text-xs max-w-xs space-y-2 pointer-events-none">
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-700/50 pb-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-emerald-400"></i> มาตรฐานดัดงอเหล็ก (Rebar Details)
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">เหล็กปลอกเสา:</span> <span>งอขอ 135° Seismic Hook</span></div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-orange-400 font-semibold">เหล็กเดือยเสา:</span> <span>งอฉากเท้าเป็ด 90° L-Splice</span></div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-sky-400 font-semibold">เหล็กฐานราก:</span> <span>งอดัดขึ้นฉาก 90° (12d_b)</span></div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-pink-400 font-semibold">เหล็กรัดรอบ:</span> <span>เหล็กรัดขอบฐานราก RB9</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hover/Click Inspection Card -->
                <div id="info-card" class="hidden absolute bottom-6 left-6 glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-sky-500/40 text-xs w-80 transition-all z-20">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <span id="card-tag" class="bg-orange-600 text-white font-bold text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">F1.30x1.30</span>
                            <h3 id="card-grid" class="font-bold text-white text-sm mt-1">Grid Position: D1</h3>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="hideInfoCard()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-base"></i></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-700/60 pt-2.5">
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>ขนาดฐานราก:</span> <span id="card-dim" class="font-mono text-white">1.30 x 1.30 x 0.25 m</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>เหล็กตะแกรงฐานราก:</span> <span id="card-rebar-mesh" class="font-mono text-sky-300">7+7 DB12 #0.15m</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>เหล็กรัดรอบฐานราก:</span> <span id="card-rebar-perim" class="font-mono text-pink-400">1-RB9 รัดรอบ</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>เหล็กแกนเสาตอม่อ:</span> <span id="card-rebar-col" class="font-mono text-amber-300">4-DB12 (L-Splice)</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>เหล็กปลอกเสา:</span> <span id="card-rebar-tie" class="font-mono text-yellow-300">RB9 @0.15m</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between"><span>คอนกรีตฐานราก:</span> <span id="card-vol" class="font-mono text-white">0.42 m³</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BOQ Summary Table View -->
            <div id="view-boq" class="hidden absolute inset-0 top-[49px] w-full h-[calc(100%-49px)] bg-slate-950 p-6 overflow-y-auto">
                <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-6">

                    <!-- Header Banner -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar text-emerald-400"></i> ใบถอดแบบและประเมินราคาเหล็กเสริม & คอนกรีต (BOQ)
                            </h2>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">คำนวณจากปริมาณความยาวเหล็กเสริมจริง + ระยะงอขอฉาก (Hook 90°/135°) + เหล็กรัดรอบ + เผื่อสูญเสียตามมาตรฐาน</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-3 rounded-xl flex gap-6 text-center">
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">เหล็กเสริมรวม (Kg)</div>
                                <div id="boq-header-steel" class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 font-mono">0.00 kg</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="border-r border-slate-800"></div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">คอนกรีตรวม (m³)</div>
                                <div id="boq-header-conc" class="text-sm font-bold text-sky-400 font-mono">0.00 m³</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="border-r border-slate-800"></div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">ยอดรวมสุทธิ</div>
                                <div id="boq-header-total" class="text-base font-extrabold text-emerald-400 font-mono">฿0.00</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Main BOQ Table -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="px-6 py-3.5 border-b border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-900/60">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-sky-400"></i> สรุปรายการวัสดุและประมาณการค่าใช้จ่าย
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">สกุลเงิน: บาท (THB)</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr class="bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border-b border-slate-700 font-semibold text-[11px]">
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4 w-12 text-center">ลำดับ</th>
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4">รายการวัสดุ / หมวดงานโครงสร้าง</th>
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">ปริมาณคำนวณ</th>
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">หน่วย</th>
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">ราคา/หน่วย (บาท)</th>
                                        <th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">จำนวนเงิน (บาท)</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody id="boq-table-body" class="divide-y divide-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-mono">
                                    <!-- Dynamic rows -->
                                </tbody>
                                <tfoot>
                                    <tr class="bg-slate-800/90 font-bold text-slate-100 border-t-2 border-slate-700">
                                        <td colspan="5" class="py-4 px-4 text-right font-sans">รวมงบประมาณค่าวัสดุและค่าแรงสุทธิ:</td>
                                        <td id="boq-grand-total" class="py-4 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-extrabold text-base font-mono">฿0.00</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tfoot>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Detailed Rebar Breakdown Table -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 space-y-4">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-amber-400"></i> ตารางรายละเอียดถอดแบบเหล็กเสริมแยกรายประเภทฐานราก (Detailed Rebar Schedule)
                        </h3>
                        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                            <table class="w-full text-xs text-center border border-slate-800">
                                <thead class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-semibold text-[11px]">
                                    <tr>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">ฐานราก</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">ขนาด BxLxH (ม.)</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">จำนวน</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">เหล็กตะแกรงฐานราก</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">เหล็กรัดรอบ (Side Tie)</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">เหล็กแกนเสา (Dowels)</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">เหล็กปลอกเสา (RB9)</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">น้ำหนักเหล็ก/ฐาน (กก.)</th>
                                        <th class="p-2.5 border border-slate-700">น้ำหนักเหล็กเขตรวม (กก.)</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
